WEBVTT

00:00.520 --> 00:02.160
Come with me to reinforce the west

00:02.240 --> 00:03.520
To prevent anyone from taking advantage

00:03.680 --> 00:04.800
And coordinating with the Wunu

00:04.880 --> 00:05.680
To seize the gates

00:05.800 --> 00:07.200
I accept the order

00:12.000 --> 00:25.000
You hurried with your men to reinforce the west of the city. The chaos in the west was swiftly brought under control by you, but suddenly a commotion broke out within the city, followed by soaring flames rising from the south.

00:26.600 --> 00:27.880
Brother-in-law, hurry

00:27.960 --> 00:29.160
The south grain depot is on fire

00:29.240 --> 00:30.440
Yiyang can't be held

00:30.520 --> 00:31.360
Shut up

00:31.480 --> 00:32.400
They're going to run

00:32.520 --> 00:33.840
Even Prince of Jin is running

00:34.000 --> 00:35.160
The Wunu are coming

00:35.240 --> 00:36.440
Retreat quickly

00:36.520 --> 00:37.040
Stop

00:37.120 --> 00:38.280
Hurry

00:38.360 --> 00:39.760
Stop

00:40.000 --> 00:41.120
Stop

00:46.500 --> 00:56.500
In the eleventh month of the nineteenth year of Yuankang, Yiyang fell. Shi Lang captured large numbers of volunteer soldiers and forced them under interrogation to reveal the Prince of Jin's escape route, then personally led his iron cavalry in pursuit, riding three hundred li in a single day, and personally slew Sikong Yao beneath his horse.

